<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 10334 0 R/Alt(Five stacked single-trial rasters of trained PING under per-I-cell jitter at sigma 0, 1, 5, 9 and 50 ms; E spikes black, I spikes red. Crisp vertical I-bursts at sigma 0 smear at sigma 1 and dissolve into continuous asynchronous I firing by sigma 5, while E firing goes silent.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 16505 0 R>>
